*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0030
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 281
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0030.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 STUDENT-IND        PIC X.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUSTOMER-AGE       PIC 9(3).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN STUDENT-IND = 'Y' AND CUSTOMER-AGE LESS THAN 26
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
        WHEN CUSTOMER-AGE NOT LESS THAN 65
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 6 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
